The '''Fountain City''' is the final [[Locations|island]] of the [[First Sea]].

==Appearance==
The most notable feature of the Fountain City is its massive fountain in the center, with water flowing downwards towards the island. The land around the island is slanted downwards, towards a large, arched seawall surrounding the island. There are many small rivers that flow away from the fountain and into the ocean through granite arches in the wall. Besides this, the island has some houses and trees, and grass where it is not paved.

