== Secret Quests ==

* Head to the largest, central fountain. Hit the pipes with M1s to realign them, fixing water pressure through the pipes. Once all the pipes are aligned and the water pressure is fixed, the boat will be ready to be launched out. Hop on the driver seat and be blasted off the top of the fountain into the sea.
* There will be a platform with grey-ish wooden platforms on it to the left of the [[Freezeburg Quest Giver]]. Lift the platform  about every 15min to reveal a manhole leading to the sewers. Enter the manhole, defeat the enemies in each room, and break down the wall to continue on to the next room. In the third and final room will be the boss the player must kill.
* When [[Cyborg (Boss)|Cyborg]] awakens, a message will appear in chat saying: '''[[System Messages|''"The junkyard has been magnetized by lightning..."'']]'''  On the ground surrounding Cyborg, the wires will be damaged. Repair them using any attack, this will start the boss sequence.  After they are defeated, a message will appear in chat saying:  '''[[System Messages|''"(Roblox username) repaired the junkyard wires and put the Cyborg down"'']]'''

