==Trivia==
* [[Galley Pirate]]s can be farmed at Lv. 1 for a large boost in [[Levels]] and [[Mastery]].
* The Fountain City is the largest island in the [[First Sea]].
* There is a diamond [[Chests|chest]] at the top of the fountain.
* Like some of the rivers found in [[Hydra Island]], the [[water]] here will not damage [[Blox Fruit]] users.
* Due to the fountain's great height, the Fountain City is visible from anywhere in the [[First Sea]].
* Some [[Wanted Poster|Wanted Posters]] can be found at the docks of the Fountain City.
* It is recommended to farm the [[Cyborg (Boss)|Cyborg]] boss until Lv.725 in order to be better prepared for the [[Second Sea|Second Sea]].
* There is a glitch where, by dashing into one of the poles on the bridges, the player can be flung into the air.
* As of Update 30, the whole island has been reworked.
* When you unlock the Galley Captains quest, it is recommended to keep grinding the Galley Pirates.

